    },
    "Its clone goes to the Trash and its commands stop loading; its preferences are kept." : {
      "comment" : "克隆的文件夹会移到废纸篓，它的命令不再加载；偏好设置会保留。 — Sources/AllInOneIME/ExtensionSourcesSettings.swift",
