    "The code signature of %@ doesn't check out (%@); the download may be damaged or altered. Please download it again from Releases." : {
      "comment" : "%@ 的签名不对（%@），下载的文件可能已损坏或被改过，请从 Releases 重新下载。 — Sources/AllInOneIMEInstaller/Installer.swift",
